OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe weekend will get off to a
OL,6,Fgrey start with patchy drizzle. Some
OL,7,Fheavier and generally more persistent
OL,8,Frain will arrive from the south
OL,9,Fthrough the morning, accompanied by
OL,10,Fbrisk winds. Somewhat drier and
OL,11,Flocally brighter weather should arrive
OL,12,Flater.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny lingering rain will soon
OL,15,Fclear in the east this evening,
OL,16,Fleaving a mostly dry night with clear
OL,17,Fperiods for a while. However, some
OL,18,Fshowers arriving from the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
